WEBVTT

00:11:57.956 --> 00:12:02.196
And I think we need to challenge
the narratives that we are given

00:12:02.236 --> 00:12:03.996
and change the story

00:12:04.036 --> 00:12:07.196
and start to think of the deep sea
as a place which is fascinating,

00:12:07.236 --> 00:12:09.276
it's wonderful, it's interesting,

00:12:09.316 --> 00:12:10.956
and it's really, really important.

00:12:10.956 --> 00:12:12.516
And only at that point,

00:12:12.516 --> 00:12:15.396
if we take all that on board
will we ever truly,

00:12:15.396 --> 00:12:19.156
truly protect and live
alongside our oceans.

00:12:21.476 --> 00:12:22.636
Thank you.

00:12:22.676 --> 00:12:25.676
(Applause)